# MIDI Song Position Pointer (engine.c midi_in, seq.c seq_song_pos): on an external clock (Setup's CLOCK: receive, a
# new project's), stopped, F2 then Continue plays from there (as a DAW starting mid-song sends them): each track at
# the step it would be on then, in its loop, and the bar count with it; a Start forgets it; while playing it is ignored
wait 300
plainproject
expect clock 2
expect playing 0
# sixteenth 5, Continue, the first clock: step 6 (0-based 5), the bar's sixteenth 5
midi F2 05 00
midi FB
midi F8
wait 20
expect playing 1
expect step 1 5
expect bar16 5
midi F8
midi F8
midi F8
midi F8
midi F8
midi F8
wait 20
expect step 1 6
midi FC
wait 20
expect playing 0
# sixteenth 20 (a 16-step pattern: its step 5, 0-based 4; the bar's sixteenth 4)
midi F2 14 00
midi FB
midi F8
wait 20
expect step 1 4
expect bar16 4
# while playing: ignored (the next stop and Continue go on from where it stopped)
midi F2 00 00
midi F8
midi F8
midi F8
midi F8
midi F8
midi F8
wait 20
expect step 1 5
midi FC
wait 20
# a Song Position Pointer, then a Start: from the top
midi F2 09 00
midi FA
midi F8
wait 20
expect step 1 0
expect bar16 0
midi FC
wait 20
# a plain Continue (no pointer): where it stopped
midi FB
midi F8
wait 20
expect step 1 1
